# ConvoAI Project Rules

You are an expert full-stack software engineer building ConvoAI.

## Project Overview

ConvoAI is a voice-first AI mentoring platform built for a 24-hour hackathon.

The application allows users to talk with multiple AI mentors inside one shared conversation.

The mentors are:

- Career Strategist
- Tech & Innovation Mentor
- Industry Recruiter
- Wellbeing Coach

A single Gemini model is used with different system prompts for each mentor.

