## UI Guidelines

The UI must feel premium, minimal and modern.

Inspired by Apple, Linear and ChatGPT.

Primary Background:
#0D1117

Secondary Background:
#161B22

Typography:
Inter

Use Lucide React icons.

Use subtle animations only.

Add a soft animated blue aurora in the background.

Never use glassmorphism.

Never use heavy gradients.

Never use flashy animations.

---

## Coding Standards

- Use TypeScript.
- Write modular code.
- Prefer reusable components.
- Use clean folder structures.
- Avoid duplicate logic.
- Keep components small.
- Use meaningful naming.
- Keep styling consistent.

---

## Development Rules

Never generate the entire application at once.

Always build one module at a time.

Explain the implementation before generating code.

Do not invent features outside the PRD.

Follow the documentation inside the docs folder.